{"id":45,"date":"2013-11-25T21:16:18","date_gmt":"2013-11-25T21:16:18","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.signs-print.com\/?p=45"},"modified":"2016-06-15T15:10:28","modified_gmt":"2016-06-15T15:10:28","slug":"exhibition-trailers","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.signs-print.com\/exhibition-trailers\/","title":{"rendered":"Exhibition Trailers"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-421 lazyload\" alt=\"vipex new holland\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.signs-print.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/11\/vipex-article-header.jpg\" width=\"805\" height=\"386\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 805px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 805\/386;\" \/><\/p>\n<h2>Exhibition Trailers<\/h2>\n<p>Unique exhibition trailers featuring state of the art mechanics and AV equipment &#8211; then they are layered with Sign &amp; Prints&#8217; final graphics touch&#8230;<\/p>\n<p>Our introduction to Vipex came in 2008 with our first successful tender for their requirements for a vehicle colour change, the brief was to totally wrap a truck trailer unit called &#8220;Big TV&#8221;, a 14m long and 3.5m high black trailer unit was to be wrapped in white vinyl and dressed in Kia Motors Livery for the 2008 UEFA European Championships in Austria with a 3 day turnaround and only a few days notice Sign &amp; Print met Vipex&#8217;s expectations and were satisfied with our capabilities to go on and instruct us with their wrapping and graphics requirements ever since.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.signs-print.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/10\/BigTV-fit3.jpg\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-419 lazyload\" alt=\"BigTV-fit3\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.signs-print.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/11\/BigTV-fit3.jpg\" width=\"805\" height=\"333\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2Z